      "name": "KGFirstRetrievalOrchestrator",
      "line_number": 145,
      "docstring": "Orchestrator for KG-first hybrid retrieval.\n\nThis orchestrator builds and executes retrieval DAGs that:\n1. First query the Knowledge Graph for structured facts\n2. Use KG entities to enhance vector search\n3. Fuse results with weighted combination\n4. Optionally rerank for relevance",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
